            <ArticleTitle>A novel method of clot extraction using a FilterWire EX in acute myocardial infarction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E104-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a novel approach for the use of a FilterWire EX distal protection device as a snaring device for clot extraction in a patient who sustained acute ST-elevation myocardial infarction due to occlusion of the right coronary artery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
